{
    "_about":  "RESGATE v1: resolution gate (Scripts/ResGate.cs, tools in _agents/laneRESGATE). DARK: needs the command-line flag -resgate AND enabled=true (run_resgate.py passes a copy with enabled=true via -resgatedata:). Sizes = the gate list (Steam share from Dom\u0027s mix). proxy = the window that gives the same virtual HUD layout when the real size does not fit the 2560x1600 laptop display (the HUD is a pure function of vw = W / s, vh = 1080, s = H / 1080, so an aspect-equivalent window proves layout; it does NOT prove real-size raster, scaling or performance). display = the largest window this laptop opens. Window-capture settings and offscreen (camera to RenderTexture, 3D only, no IMGUI) settings are read by ResGate.cs; checks{} is read by resgate_check.py only.",
